From: TB710FU clean board
Subject: [PATCH] Bracket the BSD init chain that follows the storage start

Source: XNU ac9718fb1af618d5ce8678d0dc6e8a58f252216f with the exact
ordered patches recorded by run 44870542276.

Run 44870542276 carried 0009 (quiet command probes) and passed the whole
UFS bring-up: wake-settle, lun-ready, root layout-done, source-storage
started, and "TB710FU bsd: source-storage-start done". It then stopped
without another line. The next bsd_init_kprintf is not mirrored to the
text console, so the gap between that marker and bsd-autoconf is dark.

Bracket the DEVELOPMENT probe block and the init calls that run before
bsd_autoconf. native_apfs_load_probe() is the first call after the storage
hook, so it is the first suspect; the later tags name the call that was
reached when the probe returns. Stage tags stay unconditional, matching
0009's rule that the stop point must remain readable while command probes
are quiet.

Verification: apply the prior run's hash-checked inputs to pinned source
in an isolated fixture. Validate forward application against the post-0032
tree.
---

diff --git a/bsd/kern/bsd_init.c b/bsd/kern/bsd_init.c
index 46b25ac..8e30533 100644
--- a/bsd/kern/bsd_init.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/bsd_init.c
@@ -831,31 +831,48 @@ bsd_init(void)
 	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("source-storage-start", "done\n");
 #endif
 #if DEVELOPMENT || DEBUG
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("apfs-probe", "begin\n");
 	native_apfs_load_probe();
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("apfs-probe", "done\n");
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("mgpu-probe", "begin\n");
 	native_mobile_graphics_load_probe();
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("mgpu-probe", "done\n");
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("iogpu-probe", "begin\n");
 	native_iogpu_load_probe();
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("iogpu-probe", "done\n");
 #if defined(XNU_ADRENO_FIRMWARE_PROBE) && XNU_ADRENO_FIRMWARE_PROBE
 	extern void native_adreno_firmware_probe(void);
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("adreno-fw-probe", "begin\n");
 	native_adreno_firmware_probe();
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("adreno-fw-probe", "done\n");
 #endif
 #if defined(XNU_ADRENO_PM4_PROBE) && XNU_ADRENO_PM4_PROBE
 	extern void native_adreno_pm4_probe(void);
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("adreno-pm4-probe", "begin\n");
 	native_adreno_pm4_probe();
+	TB710FU_BSD_TEXT("adreno-pm4-probe", "done\n");
 #endif
 #if defined(XNU_SMMU4K_PROBE) && XNU_SMMU4K_PROBE
